{"id":"wb-2-53","name":"湖田古瓷窑址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"湖田窑","text":"湖田窑是江西景德镇古窑，在今景德镇东南竟成乡湖田村。湖田窑创建于五代烧制青瓷和白瓷。元代烧制的湖田窑瓷器略带黄黑色，形式古雅，在浙江很流行。湖田窑在明朝中叶结束，前后历六百余年。\n湖田古瓷窑址被列为第二批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B9%96%E7%94%B0%E7%AA%91","revisionId":93650561,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93650561","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3fc5dcaf94d418638c4984ff.jpg","title":"Hutian_Kiln,_2021-09-24_06.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hutian_Kiln,_2021-09-24_06.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/Hutian_Kiln%2C_2021-09-24_06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​湖田窑遗址","width":320,"height":214}}